PLDshell Plus V5.0 README FILE
------------------------------

Thank you for your interest in PLDshell Plus development software. In 
addition to supporting the FLEXlogic device family, PLDshell Plus 
provides support for all Altera Classic devices.

If you have any questions that are not answered by this README file
or in the PLDshell Plus/PLDasm V5.0 User's Guide, contact Altera 
Applications:

Altera Corporation
Applications Department
2610 Orchard Parkway
San Jose, CA. 95134-2020
Tel: (800) 800-EPLD or (408) 894-7000

This README file contains the following sections:

o   PLDshell Plus Installation
o   Troubleshooting Installation/Operation/Memory Problems
